                        :description => "Specifies the selection type to be drawn. If *rect*, a rectangle is drawn linking (`x0`,`y0`), (`x1`,`y0`), (`x1`,`y1`) and (`x0`,`y1`). If *path*, draw a custom SVG path using `path`.",
